          "url": "https://github.com/standardagents/dmux/blob/8cb3d926631a9349ab67f7ece41d218427ac7e24/README.md#L43-L43"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_3c40a9baf33f5a0dd003d9bd143b76f78d0cdb94ab1768f639a2cd81d69bf6bb"
      ],
      "text": "First-run setup can configure a primary inference provider and optional backup, discovering models from the provider and supporting API keys, custom OpenAI-compatible endpoints, or Codex/Grok Build logins; reopened via the settings key."
    },
